on","content":"High"},"996":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-83","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#strategy-comparison","content":"Maximum quality"},"997":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-84","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#strategy-comparison","content":"`doublePassAutoMerge`"},"998":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-85","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#strategy-comparison","content":"Slow"},"999":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-86","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#strategy-comparison","content":"Full"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-87","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#strategy-comparison","content":"Auto + dedupe"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-88","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#strategy-comparison","content":"High"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-89","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#strategy-comparison","content":"Quality + arrays"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-90","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#agent-default","content":"**The Agent strategy is the default.** You don't need to specify `--strategy agent` — it's used automatically when you run `struktur extract`."},"1004":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-91","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#agent-default","content":"Autonomous extraction using a virtual filesystem. The agent decides when to read files, search for patterns, and build output incrementally."},"1005":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-92","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#agent-default","content":"<Card title=\"Best For\" description=\"Most documents — adapts automatically\" />"},"1006":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-93","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#agent-default","content":"<Card title=\"Virtual FS\" description=\"read, grep, find, ls, bash\" />"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-94","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#agent-default","content":"<Card title=\"Output Tools\" description=\"set_output_data, update_output_data\" />"},"1008":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-95","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#agent-default","content":"<Card title=\"Model Requirement\" description=\"Must support tool calling\" />"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-96","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Document loaded** into virtual filesystem (`/artifacts/artifact.json`, `/artifacts/manifest.json`, `/artifacts/images/`)"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-97","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Agent explores** using tools: read files, grep for patterns, list directories, execute commands"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-98","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Incremental extraction** — calls `set_output_data` when first data found, `update_output_data` as more discovered"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-99","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Validation** — schema validation on every output update, with automatic retry on errors"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-100","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Completion** — agent calls `finish` when done, or `fail` if extraction impossible"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-101","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"The agent adapts to your document:"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-102","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Small documents** — reads everything at once"},"1016":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-103","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Large documents** — navigates systematically, searching for relevant sections"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-104","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Complex schemas** — builds output incrementally, validating as it goes"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-105","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#configuration","content":"<TypeTable\n  type=\"{\n  model: {\n    description: 'Full model spec, e.g. `openrouter/deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash`. Alternative to passing provider and modelId separately.',\n    type: 'string | AiSdkModel',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  provider: {\n    description: 'Provider name (e.g., anthropic, openai). Required unless `model` is given.',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  modelId: {\n    description: 'Model identifier (e.g., claude-sonnet-4, gpt-4o). Required unless `model` is given.',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  maxSteps: {\n    description: 'Maximum agent steps/turns',\n    type: 'number',\n    default: '50',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  maxIterations: {\n    description: 'Number of iteration loops. Each loop allows up to maxSteps steps, so the total step budget is maxIterations x maxSteps.',\n    type: 'number',\n    default: '1',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  stepTimeoutMs: {\n    description: 'Maximum time per LLM step before it times out',\n    type: 'number',\n    default: '300000 (5 min)',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  vision: {\n    description: 'Enable image tools (`view_image`). Auto-detected from the model catalogue by default; set explicitly to override the detection.',\n    type: 'boolean',\n    default: 'detected',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  reasoningEffort: {\n    description: 'Reasoning effort for models that support it',\n    type: '&#x22;low&#x22; | &#x22;medium&#x22; | &#x22;high&#x22;',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  outputInstructions: {\n    description: 'Additional extraction guidance',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  systemPrompt: {\n    description: 'Override default system prompt',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  prefill: {\n    description:\n      'Pre-load document context as synthetic read/view_image tool calls before the first step. `textTokens` caps the text, `maxImages` (default 1) and `maxImageBytes` (default 12 MB) cap images.',\n    type: '{ textTokens: number; maxImages?: number; maxImageBytes?: number }',\n    required: false,\n  },\n}\"\n/>"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-106","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#context-prefill","content":"The agent normally spends its first steps reading `/artifact.json` and looking at the image overview. Prefill hands it that context up front so it can extract immediately:"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-107","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#context-prefill","content":"The block is deterministic — stable tool-call ids, no timestamps — so the same document always produces the same prefix and providers can prompt-cache it. Images get far less budget than text because a single page image is 1–4 MB of base64; the defaults load the image overview only."},"1021":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-108","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#when-to-use","content":"**Always try agent first** — it's the default for a reason"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-109","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#when-to-use","content":"Works well for most document types and sizes"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-110","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#when-to-use","content":"Automatically adapts to document structure"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-111","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#when-to-use","content":"Best for complex schemas with nested objects"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-112","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-requirements","content":"The agent imposes two hard requirements that the other strategies do not:"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-113","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-requirements","content":"Requirement"},"1027":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-114","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-requirements","content":"Needed for"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-115","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-requirements","content":"Why"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-116","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-requirements","content":"**Tool / function calling**"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-117","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-requirements","content":"Every agent run"},"1031":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-118","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-requirements","content":"The agent's whole loop is tool calls. A model without it cannot run the strategy at all."},"1032":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-119","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-requirements","content":"**Image input**"},"1033":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-120","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-requirements","content":"`--images`, `--screenshots`"},"1034":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-121","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-requirements","content":"Without it `view_image` is disabled, so the model never sees content that lives only in images."},"1035":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-122","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-requirements","content":"Both are hard requirements, but only one is checked for you: the agent queries the provider's model catalogue for the input modalities a model accepts, and reports the result via `onVisionStatus`. Tool/function-calling support is **not** detected — a model without it fails at the provider when the first tool call is sent. Check what a provider currently offers before choosing:"},"1036":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-123","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#model-requirements","content":"Some models advertise tool support but call tools unreliably, or reject tool-use requests outright. That surfaces as a confusing provider error rather than a clean \"unsupported\" message — if a run dies on a tool-use error, switch models."},"1037":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-124","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#speed-and-cost","content":"Wall-clock time often differs more between *deployments of the same model* than between different models. On OpenRouter, append `:nitro` to route to the fastest available provider:"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-125","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#speed-and-cost","content":"On our real-estate exposé corpus this roughly halved median extraction time for a high-volume model (\\~81s to \\~42s), but the gain depends on how loaded the default provider is — measure on your own documents rather than assuming it. `:floor` is the cheapest-provider counterpart."},"1039":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-126","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#speed-and-cost","content":"Reasoning models trade latency for thinking budget. `--reasoning-effort low` is usually enough for structured extraction, and is what Struktur's own configuration uses."},"1040":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-127","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#speed-and-cost","content":"Model availability and pricing change constantly, so this page deliberately does not pin a recommendation list. Pick a candidate from `struktur config models list`, confirm it does tool calling (and vision, if you need images), then compare it on your own documents."},"1041":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-128","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#virtual-filesystem","content":"The agent has access to a virtual filesystem containing:"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-129","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#virtual-filesystem","content":"`/artifacts/artifact.json` — All artifacts in JSON format (images replaced by virtual paths)"},"1043":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-130","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#virtual-filesystem","content":"`/artifacts/manifest.json` — Summary and metadata"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-131","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#virtual-filesystem","content":"`/artifacts/images/` — Extracted image files (when artifacts have embedded images), including the generated image overview"},"1045":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-132","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#virtual-filesystem","content":"The agent can:"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-133","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#virtual-filesystem","content":"**Read** files with pagination (`offset`, `limit`)"},"1047":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-134","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#virtual-filesystem","content":"**Grep** for patterns"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-135","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#virtual-filesystem","content":"**Find** files by name"},"1049":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-136","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#virtual-filesystem","content":"**List** directories"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-137","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#virtual-filesystem","content":"**View images** by virtual path with `view_image` (only when the model accepts image input)"},"1051":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-138","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#virtual-filesystem","content":"**Bash** execute commands (on virtual filesystem only)"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-139","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#virtual-filesystem","content":"Every extracted image carries a `virtualPath`. The image overview is a labelled contact sheet of all of them, built at parse time, so the agent can see the whole document's visual content in one image and then open only the images that matter. See Image Overview."},"1053":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-140","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#output-management","content":"Special tools for building extraction output:"},"1054":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-141","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#output-management","content":"**`set_output_data(data)`** — Set initial output (first time data is found)"},"1055":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-142","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#output-management","content":"**`update_output_data(changes)`** — Merge changes into existing output"},"1056":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-143","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#output-management","content":"**`finish()`** — Complete extraction (only works if data validates)"},"1057":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-144","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#output-management","content":"**`fail(reason)`** — Mark extraction as impossible"},"1058":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-145","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#output-management","content":"The agent is encouraged to update output continuously as it explores, not wait until the end."},"1059":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-146","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#simple","content":"Single-shot extraction for small inputs. Use when the agent is overkill for tiny documents."},"1060":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-147","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#simple","content":"<Card title=\"LLM Calls\" description=\"1\" />"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-148","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#simple","content":"<Card title=\"Parallelism\" description=\"None\" />"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-149","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#simple","content":"<Card title=\"Best for\" description=\"Small, single-chunk inputs\" />"},"1063":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-150","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#configuration-1","content":"<TypeTable\n  type=\"{\n  model: {\n    description: 'Model instance from @ai-sdk/*',\n    type: 'LanguageModel',\n    required: true,\n  },\n  outputInstructions: {\n    description: 'Extra instructions for the model',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  strict: {\n    description: 'Always true for simple (single-shot, no intermediate steps)',\n    type: 'boolean',\n    default: 'true',\n    required: false,\n  },\n}\"\n/>"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-151","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#algorithm","content":"Build extraction prompt from artifacts + schema"},"1065":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-152","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#algorithm","content":"Send to LLM"},"1066":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-153","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#algorithm","content":"Validate output against the schema"},"1067":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-154","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#algorithm","content":"Retry on validation failure (up to 3 attempts)"},"1068":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-155","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#algorithm","content":"Return validated output"},"1069":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-156","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#when-to-use-1","content":"Document fits within the model's context window (\\~10k tokens)"},"1070":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-157","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#when-to-use-1","content":"Simple schema without nested arrays"},"1071":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-158","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#when-to-use-1","content":"Testing or prototyping"},"1072":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-159","page_id":"/do