readcrumbs":["Struktur","SDK"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/events"},"1324":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-0","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/events","content":"Event handlers for progress tracking and observability."},"1325":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-1","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/events#available-events","content":"Available events"},"1326":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-2","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/events#agent-events","content":"Agent events"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-3","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/events#example-human-status-events","content":"Example: human status events"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-4","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/events#example-progress-bar","content":"Example: progress bar"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-5","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/events#example-observe-retries","content":"Example: observe retries"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-6","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/events#example-agent-activity-feed","content":"Example: agent activity feed"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-7","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/events#see-also","content":"See also"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-8","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/events#available-events","content":"<TypeTable\n  type=\"{\n  onStep: {\n    description: 'Fired at each named phase within a strategy',\n    type: '(info: { step: number; total?: number; label?: string }) => void',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  onMessage: {\n    description: 'Fired for every message in the LLM conversation',\n    type: '(msg: { role: string; content: unknown }) => void',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  onProgress: {\n    description: 'Fired when a strategy can report percentage progress',\n    type: '(progress: number) => void',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  onTokenUsage: {\n    description: 'Fired after each LLM call with token usage',\n    type: '(usage: { inputTokens: number; outputTokens: number; totalTokens: number }) => void',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  onRetry: {\n    description: 'Fired when a step is retried after a validation or provider failure',\n    type: '(info: { attempt: number; maxAttempts: number; reason?: string }) => void',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  onStatus: {\n    description: 'Human-facing status update with a coarse, strategy-independent phase',\n    type: '(info: { phase: StatusPhase; message?: { key: string; params?: Record<string, string | number> }; percent?: number | null }) => void',\n    required: false,\n  },\n}\"\n/>"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-9","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/events#agent-events","content":"These fire only from the agent strategy. Use them to render a live activity feed of what the model is doing — which tools it called, what it reasoned, and whether it can actually see images."},"1334":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-10","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/events#agent-events","content":"<TypeTable\n  type=\"{\n  onAgentToolStart: {\n    description: 'A tool call starts. `toolName` is the agent tool (`read`, `grep`, `list`, `view_image`, `set_output_data`, …), `args` are its arguments as sent by the model.',\n    type: '(info: { toolName: string; toolCallId: string; args: Record<string, unknown> }) => void',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  onAgentToolEnd: {\n    description: 'A tool call finishes or fails. Correlate with `onAgentToolStart` via `toolCallId`. `result` is the tool return value; `error` is set when the call threw.',\n    type: '(info: { toolCallId: string; result?: Record<string, unknown>; error?: string }) => void',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  onAgentMessage: {\n    description: 'A message in the agent loop, with `role` distinguishing assistant narration from user/tool turns',\n    type: '(info: { content: string; role?: &#x22;assistant&#x22; | &#x22;user&#x22; }) => void',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  onAgentReasoning: {\n    description: 'The model emitted reasoning/thinking text before acting',\n    type: '(info: { thought: string }) => void',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  onVisionStatus: {\n    description: 'Whether the agent enabled image tools. Fired once before the first step, after the model\\'s input modalities were resolved. `enabled` is `false` only when the catalogue positively reports that the model cannot accept images.',\n    type: '(info: { enabled: boolean; provider: string; modelId: string }) => void',\n    required: false,\n  },\n}\"\n/>"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-11","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/events#agent-events","content":"Vision detection fails open. If the model catalogue is unreachable or reports nothing for the model, `onVisionStatus` fires with `enabled: true` and the provider returns a clear error if the model truly cannot accept images — rather than the agent silently going text-only and producing incomplete extractions."},"1336":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-12","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/events#example-human-status-events","content":"`onStatus` carries a coarse, strategy-independent `phase` so you can render localized progress without matching internal step labels or tool names."},"1337":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-13","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/events#example-human-status-events","content":"When `percent` is `null`/absent, the strategy cannot report determinate progress (e.g. the agent strategy) — show an indeterminate spinner instead of a progress bar."},"1338":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-14","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/events#see-also","content":"extract() — main extraction function"},"1339":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-15","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/events#see-also","content":"Validation & Retries — validation concept"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-16","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/events#see-also","content":"Strategies — the agent strategy and its tools"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/sdk/events-17","page_id":"/docs/sdk/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/events#see-also","content":"CLI reference — `--format json` emits these events as NDJSON"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/sdk/extract","page_id":"/docs/sdk/extract","type":"page","content":"extract()","breadcrumbs":["Struktur","SDK"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/extract"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/sdk/extract-0","page_id":"/docs/sdk/extract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/extract","content":"Main extraction function for the TypeScript SDK."},"1344":{"id":"/docs/sdk/extract-1","page_id":"/docs/sdk/extract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/extract#usage","content":"Usage"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/sdk/extract-2","page_id":"/docs/sdk/extract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/extract#options","content":"Options"},"1346":{"id":"/docs/sdk/extract-3","page_id":"/docs/sdk/extract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/extract#result","content":"Result"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/sdk/extract-4","page_id":"/docs/sdk/extract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/extract#using-fields-instead-of-schema","content":"Using `fields` instead of `schema`"},"1348":{"id":"/docs/sdk/extract-5","page_id":"/docs/sdk/extract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdk/extract#see-also","content":"See also"},"1349":{"id":"/docs/sdk/extract-6","page_id":"/docs/sdk/extract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/extract#options","content":"<TypeTable\n  type=\"{\n  artifacts: {\n    description: 'Array of artifacts to extract from',\n    type: 'Artifact[]',\n   